{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Mere sar pe [Bm]hogi dhun teri [G],        Tere sar pe [C]mera fa [D]toor Ho [G]ga
[Em]Mujhe tumpe [Bm]naaz hai jitna,        Tumhe [G]mujpe [C]utna gu [D]roor ho [G]ga
[C]Main laila ki [Am]tarah,        [D]Tu majnoo sa [Bm]mashoor ho gaya
[Em]Dekhna ye [Am]ek din,        [D]zaroor ho [Bm]ga
[Em]Dekhna ye [Am]ek din,        [D]Zaroor ho [G]ga
[Em]Dekhna ye [Am]ek din,        [D]Zaroor ho [G]ga
[Em]Chandani se [D]dhoop tak,        [C]Wahi pe bikhre [Bm]gi
[Am7]Jis jagah,        [D]Milenge hum yeh dekhnaa
[Em]Aasman bhi [D]tootega,        [C]Zameen bhi pighle [G]gi
[Am]Jis jagah [G]milenge hum,        Yeh [D]dekhnaa
[B]Bechanion ka samaa rahega,        [C]Hoga bhi yeh dekh [Em]naa
